r Mastery.\n\t\tThrowing Knives count as melee attacks for the purpose of on-hit effects.\n\t\tEffective Throwing Knife Stats:\n\n%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"装备一条最多可容纳 %d 把飞刀的刀带，使你能够进行远程攻击。休息时每回合自动装填 %d 把飞刀，移动时装填数量减半。\n\t\t飞刀的基础强度、护甲穿透和暴击几率随技能等级提高，命中随你的命中值提高，伤害受匕首掌握加成。\n\t\t投掷飞刀可触发近战命中效果。\n\t\t投掷飞刀属性：\n\n%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"98c92f974a7a7fd596712c6f8138d4b8b0734f59bfa6979ee9393277d42b8a6c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5024931492e885579e0aff1b3faf7c5757ac88d66e1e9c6512f327268c3e65ae","logical_entry_identity":"fd2d6414d7a3f6cf27dcfd46500606479141454b83c3f5793c2fe02a23818415","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Randomly generate actors subject to a filter and/or create random bosses according to a data table.\nFilters are interpreted by game.zone:checkFilter.\n#ORANGE#Boss Data:#LAST# is interpreted by game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, and Actor.levelupClass.\nGeneration is performed within the _G environment (used by the Lua Console) using the current zone's #LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#.\nPress #GOLD#'F1'#LAST# for help.\nMouse over controls for an actor preview (which may be further adjusted when placed on to the level).\n(Press #GOLD#'L'#LAST# to lua inspect or #GOLD#'C'#LAST# to open the character sheet.)\n\nThe #LIGHT_BLUE#Base Filter#LAST# is used to filter the actor randomly generated.","source_tag":"_t","target":"根据给定的筛选器随机生成角色，或/并根据给定的数据表生成随机Boss。\n筛选器由game.zone:checkFilter处理。\n#ORANGE#Boss数据：#LAST#由 game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, 和 Actor.levelupClass处理。\n生成过程在 _G 环境下进行（也是 Lua 控制台使用的环境），并使用当前地图的#LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#。\n请按#GOLD#'F1'#LAST#获得帮助。\n鼠标移动查看角色预览（放置到楼层时可能会被进一步调整）。\n（请按 #GOLD#'L'#LAST# 在Lua中检查，或按 #GOLD#'C'#LAST# 打开角色面板）\n\n#LIGHT_BLUE#基础过滤器#LAST#用于过滤生成的随机角色。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d152a49978b0578e752ca8395f7fdec4f72a49f5860e25947d47706c007512c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5024b5fd241a16af60baaa25bc3335d739f5e19ab83b