a28616e9f8b824fdcacb34664da92db35731c0da932d5e7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"504bf3b54131624cf27421478f13373212d58b617ff3115a2927f2c247cff3bc","logical_entry_identity":"cc2002c4fb42ce6fac4b49afebefc22ee2b6a560118ef3ec3165fdbf8f498d4c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your preternatural senses aid you in your hunt for the next victim. You sense foes in a radius of %0.1f. You will always sense a stalked victim in a radius of 10.\n\t\tAlso increases stealth detection by %d and invisibility detection by %d.\n\t\tStealth and invisibility detection improves with your Willpower","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的超自然感官能帮助你搜寻下一个猎物。\n\t\t你能感觉到 %0.1f 码半径范围内的敌人。\n\t\t在 10 码半径范围内你总能看见被追踪的目标。\n\t\t同时增加你的侦测潜行等级 %d，侦测隐形等级 %d。\n\t\t侦测强度受意志加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d5877f61bb56d15129f4a2cf5f0037403b1bb73ecce231b4545766849bf2d476","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"504de6d865eb9bc863dab4cf20efbdec43860de29a26cf02a0dd7a2489b56659","logical_entry_identity":"d27ed00d47f8549b5528050f0327ced41f3c4f87d2cfcc2d1813d1f9aa155d95","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Pale King, part two","source_tag":"_t","target":"苍白之王，第二章"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20b1905cbb0db52b6a71fa2b0c51b7c5ee1331005f85149869808922908d0742","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"504e754537a31c42d807d78964fda84909ae6c96a80dbd0fc6d99ad0e5f5cea9","logical_entry_identity":"a36f360f2ef01f9de4ce66e03dbfd95b0122fdaf7e5933d4c84918d7e5d6579e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"P. power:","source_tag":"_t","target":"物理强度："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1075a5565512d93d05e5ba7814e90017da60f943d4e36a91692dfb13d28d9b61","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5052d51baee126d14933dab491f270ca915a633cb785793e9bc3ed3f9fc9e5e1","logical_entry_identity":"9f35cd7e85cdee6868a9672f2d8e6792877270911b8bdfb90196aea419fbcee1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You are crushed by the collapsing tunnel! You suffocate!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你被压在了倒塌的通道中！你感到无法呼吸！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ac6cadd18569d2940a4732db89a644d3c25415a1bd16a3afd961ab5a4ad06ff5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5055f0b4858b02ea4ab022d93dd0571139bd42d1c5eb6c9ea3ff46c9006e4a61","logical_entry_identity":"6781a8b512f7624d7eff9fe0d7f881976fa2bf32f729adac45bcfd74264a7341","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"acid alchemy","source_tag":"talent type","target":"酸性炼金"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"539425928af1f23cd9bce6e73c1d0ba2c83ece559f87c8304a955e41b47a3eae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5061648c88d699ad28671aff588aae68ae629f7b5b0e46e97a2c6f5f4c13783a","logical_entry_identity":"a1f6e981d6149474e0853cfc0583a1256fb16059cffec51662483a22b94333e2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@playername@, this message is of utmost importance.\n\nOur elders searched the old texts looking for clues about the staff of which you spoke.\nIt turns out to be a powerful object indeed, able to absorb the power of places, and beings.\nThis must not fall in the wrong hands, which certainly include orcish hands.\nWhile you were gone, one of our patrols met a group of orcs led by Ukruk. We could not stop them, but we managed to capture one of them.\nHe did not know much, but he did speak about \"masters\" in the Far East.\nHe spoke about meeting with Golbug -- this seems to be a warmaster in Reknor -- to send a \"package\" through a portal.\n\nThis calls for urgency; should you find this Golbug or the portal, please investigate.\n\n               #GOLD#-- Tolak, King of the Allied Kingdoms","source_tag":"_t","target":"@playername@，这份报告极其重要。\n\n我们的长老从古老文献中查找你提到的那个法杖的线索。\n它的确是一件非常强大的物品，可以吸收地点和生物的力量。\n所以它绝对不能落入坏人的手中，很显然包括兽人。\n你不在的时候，我们的一个巡逻队遭遇了乌克鲁克带领的一群兽人，\n我们没法阻止他们，不过我们抓了他们中的一个。\n\n他知道的不多，但他提到了远东大陆的“主人”。\n他提到了与高尔布格会面——貌似是瑞库纳的一位战争领主——以便将一个“包\n裹”送过传送门。\n\n事情非常紧急；如果你找到这个高尔布格或那个传送门，请务必调查。\n\n\t\t\t   #GOLD#-- 托拉克，联合王国国王。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1354b4fc62b96457d8b5cf814d933938fde1ddab476c078f556f846ed21ac3d9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5065b2e3e29b9a4551c3d80a1fe1aadf0cd4fe3371c30ce73697a6a19dd0de29","logical_entry_identity":"ca5776b130e0d3956b0955bcbd82b03ac69fdc1a22c15c7cd2ed7fddcab146e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"thick","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"厚"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"765c238eba4d1bd7268e3d1a8dcd7b821896be6b6638c0d0655def9d794278fb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5066bd7e7531c0b4e6fba16c6e817084a4eefe7b21c43b6645add2363bb0b6d7","logical_entry_identity":"b8e9d2da138e1e6749aa5ec19c07334c54490a4137d046ad09523df5ab468f30","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your cunning manipulations allow you to use charms (wands, totems and torques) more efficiently, reducing their cooldowns and the power cost of all usable items by %d%%.\n\t\tIn addition your knowledge of devices allows you to disarm known traps (%d disarm 'power', improves with Cunning).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你精于操控装置，能更有效地使用护符（魔杖、图腾和项圈），使所有可用物品的冷却时间和能量消耗降低 %d%%。\n\t\t此外，你对装置的了解使你能够解除已发现的陷阱（解除强度 %d，随灵巧提高）。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}}